  "title": "2026-09-08-reflow-152600 · chat-assistant-rollout",
  "description": "# Support assistant and staged rollout\nRead the live conversation left to right: web/mobile chat passes input safety, then context assembly combines durable customer facts, the live transcript and relevant help-center articles. A model generates replies and invokes billing/account actions with per-call vault credentials. Output safety passes a reply or substitutes a safe fallback; repeated triggers or customer requests escalate with transcript, profile context and attempted actions.\n\nBelow, completed transcripts are distilled into durable profile facts, superseding contradictions and retaining source conversation IDs. Expired raw logs move to recoverable compliance-only cold history, excluded from live retrieval.\n\nAt lower right, versioned configuration selects champion versus a small challenger sample. Automated judges assess resolution, grounding and tone, accumulating a report per challenger. A product owner gates promotion; approved configuration swaps retain the previous champion for one-step rollback. Independent quality monitoring tracks per-variant resolution, handoffs and safety and immediately removes regressing challengers.",
